			description: [
				"Equivalent to a higher-power Energy Hatch (target hatch) and Dynamo Hatch (source hatch); they can only be used on machines or generators whose description says &eAllows using laser hatches&r, and they can likewise &bdouble-hatch boost&r (if two laser hatches are allowed)"
				""
				"Normal Laser Hatches are connected with normal Laser Cables (no energy loss), and the cables cannot turn, so use an Active Transformer to turn the laser; Wireless Laser Hatches interact directly with the wireless energy network once placed, with no extra operations needed."
				""
				"Maximum power can reach 4194304A/hatch voltage"
				""
				"Note: even if a machine's description contains the words &oAllows using laser hatches&r, in most cases &l&cLaser Target Hatches still cannot replace Energy Hatches in multiblock structures&r&r&r (a few exceptions, such as the Deep Chemical Distorter and the Nano Forge, can only use Laser Target Hatches and cannot use Energy Hatches; while the Compressed Fusion Reactor can have its Energy Hatches replaced with Laser Target Hatches; please refer to the multiblock JEI page and the machine controller's description)"
